==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*8 [[Hermit Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Master Da Xun]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite easy for a Merciless stage.

This battle will be fought at your base because of the Mr. Angel rushing at the start and how quickly the boss enemies spawn despite the size of the stage. Use a solid stack of ranged attackers to kill the Mr. Angels. Master Da Xun can be helpful. When the waves of Pigge Backs spawn they can give a lot of money for some [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]. However, if you are unprepared they can push allowing the other enemies to hit the base.

